                      (    forth6809.asm):10350         ; UNTIL AGAIN WHILE REPEAT are rebuilt from branch targets by scanning
                      (    forth6809.asm):10351         ; the definition (DQ), so the shape is right but ENDOF and ENDCASE
                      (    forth6809.asm):10352         ; show as ELSE and THEN. A word whose first byte is neither JSR nor RTS
